<title>JAPAN: BOJ governor to return from China on July 27.</title>
<headline>BOJ governor to return from China on July 27.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will return from a visit to China on July 27, instead of July 28 as earlier scheduled, the central bank said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Matsushita arrived in China on July 23 to attend a meeting of executives of East Asian and Pacific central banks in Shanghai.</p>
</text>
